      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not the foundation; you are the soil that grows from it, and even if the soil is rocky, the roots can still find a way to reach the sun. The shame you feel is a heavy weight, but it does not define your worth or your ability to create something beautiful. You do not need to erase your history to honor your family; instead, you can carry their lessons forward and build a future that is stronger because you are here.",
