      "content": "but that's just selfish, isn't it? staying here just to keep making messes. if i were truly selfless, i'd put their name first. if the tree is dying because of me, the only thing a person of honor would do is prune the branch so the rest of the tree can live. it feels like the only way to actually show respect is to remove the source of the shame.",
